      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">关于外汇流动性的常见误解是什么？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "td715e9d0f0c83410",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Forex liquidity is often confused with several related but different concepts.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">外汇流动性经常与几个相关但不同的概念混淆。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t107561449309f836",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">This is incorrect.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">这是不正确的。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tac2cbccb08637239",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A liquid pair can still move sharply when new information changes what buyers and sellers are willing to pay.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">当新信息改变买家和卖家愿意支付的价格时，流动性货币对仍可能大幅波动。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t861f893a942065b8",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">High Liquidity Means Zero Slippage</span>",
