    },
    {
      "key": "t6b92fb9bcf709227",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">This is one reason session timing can matter when evaluating spreads and execution conditions.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">这也是评估点差和成交条件时，交易时段的时间安排可能很重要的原因之一。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t5aae92b6fc328f92",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The Lowest Spread Always Means the Most Liquid Market</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
