        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">最低点差始终意味着最具流动性的市场</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t789913e8786d5e52",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A tight spread can be associated with strong liquidity, but spread is only one indicator.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">较小的点差可能与较强的流动性相关，但点差只是一个指标。</span>"
    },
