    },
    {
      "key": "t3a69c335c3d27cfb",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What is liquidity in forex?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">什么是外汇流动性？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t1b08adcc6174c416",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Liquidity in forex describes how easily a currency pair can be bought or sold using available market prices without a relatively small transaction causing a material price movement. Higher liquidity normally means more buying and selling interest is available near the current price, while lower liquidity means market depth is thinner.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">外汇流动性描述了按市场可用价格买卖货币对的容易程度，即相对较小的交易不会造成显著价格变动。流动性较高通常意味着当前价格附近有更多买卖意愿，而流动性较低则意味着市场深度较薄。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "td055319f05eef6b1",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What are the most liquid forex pairs?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">流动性最强的外汇对是什么？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "ta15dd384139e2b90",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">How does liquidity affect forex spreads?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">流动性如何影响外汇点差？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tadce0b5a6b3db10c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Higher liquidity generally supports tighter spreads because more buyers and sellers compete close to the current market price. Lower liquidity can leave a larger gap between the best available bid and ask, which may cause spreads to widen. Volatility and broker pricing conditions also influence the spread.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">更高的流动性通常会支持更小的价差，因为更多的买家和卖家在接近当前市场价格的情况下进行竞争。流动性降低可能会导致最佳买入价和卖出价之间的差距更大，这可能会导致价差扩大。波动性和经纪商定价条件也会影响点差。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "ta7c0418b6a208461",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">How does liquidity affect slippage?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">流动性如何影响滑点？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t1c6677190908f0f5",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What is high liquidity in forex?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">什么是外汇的高流动性？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tc0f3ef63e3c97291",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">High liquidity means substantial trading interest and market depth are available around current prices. Highly liquid forex pairs generally support tighter spreads and more consistent execution under normal conditions, although liquidity can still change during major news, session transitions or unusual market events.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">高流动性意味着当前价格附近存在大量交易兴趣和市场深度。流动性高的外汇货币对通常在正常情况下支持更小的点差和更一致的执行，尽管流动性在重大新闻、交易时段转换或异常市场事件期间仍可能发生变化。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tfeb889f5bcd37c25",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">When is forex liquidity usually highest?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">外汇流动性通常什么时候最高？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tcdd0aabb36a0570d",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">No. Liquidity measures the availability of buying and selling interest, while volatility measures how much and how quickly prices change. A market can be both liquid and volatile, especially around major economic announcements when trading activity is high but prices are repricing rapidly.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-forex-liquidity"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">没有。流动性衡量买卖兴趣的可用性，而波动性衡量价格变化的程度和速度。市场可能既具有流动性又具有波动性，尤其是在重大经济公告发布时，交易活动很高，但价格正在迅速重新定价。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tbdf08618c66449b2",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Slippage happens when a forex or CFD order executes at a different price from the price a trader expected when placing the order. The difference can be favorable, unfavorable, or sometimes nonexistent if the expected and execution prices match.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">当外汇或差价合约订单的实际成交价格与交易者下单时预期的价格不同时，就会发生滑点。该差异可能有利，也可能不利；如果预期价与成交价相同，则没有差异。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t92fc48dd0ad6ac23",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Is Slippage in Trading?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">什么是交易滑点？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tc7e03f17520fbdff",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">If the same buy order instead executes at 1.1047, the fill is 3 pips lower than expected. That would represent </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">positive slippage</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">如果同一笔买单反而在1.1047成交，成交价格就比预期低3点。这属于</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">正滑点</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tce09c6259db4a5ed",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Is Slippage the Same as Spread?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">滑点和点差一样吗？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t1c043daa8d9aabd8",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">spread</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> is the difference between an instrument's bid and ask prices at a particular moment.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">点差</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">是某一金融工具在特定时刻买入价与卖出价之间的差额。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "td4b66008b527ff40",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Difference between the current bid and ask price</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">当前买入价和卖出价之间的差异</span>"
    }
  ]
}
